  "goodToKnow": "Knacken means to crack: Nüsse knacken, ein Schloss knacken, einen Code knacken, die Millionengrenze knacken (to pass the million mark). It also means to creak or crackle: Das Feuer knackt. Der Nussknacker is a nutcracker, and wooden Nussknacker from the Erzgebirge are Christmas classics. Knackig means crunchy (ein knackiger Salat) and casually punchy or fit. Etwas zu knacken haben means to have something tough to deal with."
